window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/comm-v28-175-5b2593e8448f4b36.json"]={sha256:"5b2593e8448f4b36e76bf2dfb3f069367ab269139386efccbea822806a0892c8",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v28-case-116e50572626a3ed","url":"https://www.2africacable.net/faq","title":"2Africa cable system: project and landing overview","titleEn":"2Africa cable system: project and landing overview","publisher":"2Africa consortium","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-175","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-175","related":[{"id":"comm-v28-176","referenceUrls":["https://cloud.google.com/blog/products/infrastructure/announcing-googles-grace-hopper-subsea-cable-system/"],"title":"Grace Hopper：光切換期間的服務缺口","titleEn":"Grace Hopper: service deficit during optical switching","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：由另一學徒只使用交付檔案重建兩情境與判定；需同時保留未通過情境。 教學共同不可用上限0.001；原設計失敗、分離設施後的假設模型通過；實際機率需維運證據。 landing_risk_tree.json、共同資產清單與條件機率表 保留輸入、逐項中間值、名義 0.0050995 與變更 0.00019999 probability、反例、驗收判定與模型限制，供另一學徒從零重算。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: A second apprentice must reconstruct both scenarios and decisions using only the handover files; retain failing cases as well. Teaching joint unavailability limit0.001:original fails and the separated-facility assumption passes; operational evidence is needed for actual probabilities. landing_risk_tree.json, shared-asset inventory and conditional probabilities Preserve inputs, intermediate values, nominal 0.0050995 and changed 0.00019999 probability, counterexamples, acceptance decisions and model limits so another apprentice can reproduce them.","difference":"完成兩組條件的可重算判定，指出哪些觀察能區分原因。 教學無服務資料預算2 GB；0.2 s通過、1.5 s失敗；若有緩衝需另驗容量與清空時間。","differenceEn":"Produce reproducible decisions for both configurations and identify observations that discriminate causes. Teaching unserved-data budget2 GB:0.2 s passes and1.5 s fails; buffering requires its own capacity and drain-time validation.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以2Africa多登陸系統為背景；合成兩路各不可用機率0.01，共同設施機率0.005；改善後共同機率0.0001。 名義式 0.005+(1-0.005)*0.01*0.01 = 0.0050995 probability；變更式 0.0001+(1-0.0001)*0.01*0.01 = 0.00019999 probability。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 列共同失效/未失效互斥樹，各葉機率總和需為1；用條件蒙地卡羅抽樣核對量級，不把小樣本零故障當零風險。","合成流量40 Gbit/s、切換中斷0.2 s；擾動為1.5 s，暫不計緩衝，非Grace Hopper實測。 名義式 40e9*0.2/8/1e9 = 1 GB；變更式 40e9*1.5/8/1e9 = 7.5 GB。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 用1 ms時間格積分無服務區間的位元數，再除8轉byte；記錄十進位GB與GiB差異。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["2Africa motivates a multi-landing exercise:two synthetic paths each unavailable with probability0.01, common facility0.005, improved to0.0001. Nominal 0.005+(1-0.005)*0.01*0.01 = 0.0050995 probability; changed 0.0001+(1-0.0001)*0.01*0.01 = 0.00019999 probability. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Enumerate mutually exclusive common-failure branches summing to one; conditionally simulate to check scale without treating zero observed failures as zero risk.","Synthetic40 Gbit/s offered load with0.2 s interruption, changed to1.5 s; ignore buffering and do not treat these as Grace Hopper measurements. Nominal 40e9*0.2/8/1e9 = 1 GB; changed 40e9*1.5/8/1e9 = 7.5 GB. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Integrate unserved bits in1 ms intervals and divide by eight; record the distinction between decimalGB andGiB.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"comm-v28-185","referenceUrls":["https://arxiv.org/abs/1109.1473"],"title":"MDI-QKD：雙臂損耗與符合機率","titleEn":"MDI-QKD: two-arm loss and coincidence probability","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：由另一學徒只使用交付檔案重建兩情境與判定；需同時保留未通過情境。 教學共同不可用上限0.001；原設計失敗、分離設施後的假設模型通過；實際機率需維運證據。 landing_risk_tree.json、共同資產清單與條件機率表 保留輸入、逐項中間值、名義 0.0050995 與變更 0.00019999 probability、反例、驗收判定與模型限制，供另一學徒從零重算。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: A second apprentice must reconstruct both scenarios and decisions using only the handover files; retain failing cases as well. Teaching joint unavailability limit0.001:original fails and the separated-facility assumption passes; operational evidence is needed for actual probabilities. landing_risk_tree.json, shared-asset inventory and conditional probabilities Preserve inputs, intermediate values, nominal 0.0050995 and changed 0.00019999 probability, counterexamples, acceptance decisions and model limits so another apprentice can reproduce them.","difference":"完成兩組條件的可重算判定，指出哪些觀察能區分原因。 教學符合代理門檻0.001/attempt；原情境通過、A臂受損失敗；MDI的接收端威脅模型不免除光源驗證。","differenceEn":"Produce reproducible decisions for both configurations and identify observations that discriminate causes. Teaching proxy threshold0.001 per attempt:baseline passes and lossyA fails; theMDI receiver threat model does not remove source characterization.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以2Africa多登陸系統為背景；合成兩路各不可用機率0.01，共同設施機率0.005；改善後共同機率0.0001。 名義式 0.005+(1-0.005)*0.01*0.01 = 0.0050995 probability；變更式 0.0001+(1-0.0001)*0.01*0.01 = 0.00019999 probability。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 列共同失效/未失效互斥樹，各葉機率總和需為1；用條件蒙地卡羅抽樣核對量級，不把小樣本零故障當零風險。","合成兩臂透過率均0.1，偵測效率0.8；只把A臂改為0.01，其他固定。 名義式 0.5*0.1*0.1*0.8**2 = 0.0032 probability/attempt；變更式 0.5*0.01*0.1*0.8**2 = 0.00032 probability/attempt。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 枚舉A到達、B到達、雙偵測、Bell篩選四個條件；A多10 dB損耗應使代理量縮小10倍。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["2Africa motivates a multi-landing exercise:two synthetic paths each unavailable with probability0.01, common facility0.005, improved to0.0001. Nominal 0.005+(1-0.005)*0.01*0.01 = 0.0050995 probability; changed 0.0001+(1-0.0001)*0.01*0.01 = 0.00019999 probability. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Enumerate mutually exclusive common-failure branches summing to one; conditionally simulate to check scale without treating zero observed failures as zero risk.","Synthetic arm transmissions0.1 each and detector efficiency0.8; change only armA to0.01. Nominal 0.5*0.1*0.1*0.8**2 = 0.0032 probability/attempt; changed 0.5*0.01*0.1*0.8**2 = 0.00032 probability/attempt. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Multiply the four conditions of arrivalA, arrivalB, two detections and Bell filtering; an extra10 dB onA should reduce the proxy tenfold.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v28-case-f67f5d2d76b9c890","url":"https://cloud.google.com/blog/products/infrastructure/announcing-googles-grace-hopper-subsea-cable-system/","title":"Announcing the Grace Hopper subsea cable system","titleEn":"Announcing the Grace Hopper subsea cable system","publisher":"Google Cloud","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v28-case-c355c172c99d486e","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1109.1473","title":"Lo, Curty and Qi: Measurement-device-independent QKD","titleEn":"Lo, Curty and Qi: Measurement-device-independent QKD","publisher":"Lo, Curty and Qi / arXiv","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
